@host = https://localhost:7223
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@bodyRefreshToken = paste-body-refresh-token-here
@oldBodyRefreshToken = paste-the-previous-refresh-token-here
@csrfToken = paste-cookie-login-csrf-token-here

### 公開 API
GET {{host}}/api/demo/public
Accept: application/json

### Body Login：複製 accessToken 與 refreshToken 到上方變數
POST {{host}}/api/auth/body/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

### 使用 Access Token
GET {{host}}/api/demo/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Body Refresh：成功後舊 Refresh Token 立即失效
POST {{host}}/api/auth/body/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{bodyRefreshToken}}"
}

### 重放舊 Token：應為 401，並撤銷同 family 的新 Token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/body/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{oldBodyRefreshToken}}"
}

### Body Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/body/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{bodyRefreshToken}}"
}

### Cookie Login：HTTP client 應保存 response cookies；複製 csrfToken
POST {{host}}/api/auth/cookie/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 重新取得 antiforgery request token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/cookie/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Cookie Refresh：Refresh Token 不放在 body
POST {{host}}/api/auth/cookie/refresh
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Cookie Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/cookie/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
